{"title":"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 23","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/0/dc09e15e56911108f1091460e8e7091fb9a55e14.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw(circle((0,0),10),black+linewidth(.75)); draw((-10,0)--(10,0),black+linewidth(.75)); draw((-10,0)--(9,sqrt(19)),black+linewidth(.75)); draw((-10,0)--(9,-sqrt(19)),black+linewidth(.75)); draw((2,0)--(9,sqrt(19)),black+linewidth(.75)); draw((2,0)--(9,-sqrt(19)),black+linewidth(.75)); MP(&quot;X&quot;,(2,0),N);MP(&quot;A&quot;,(-10,0),W);MP(&quot;D&quot;,(10,0),E);MP(&quot;B&quot;,(9,sqrt(19)),E);MP(&quot;C&quot;,(9,-sqrt(19)),E); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"208\" />\n</p><p>Points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/8/a9874ea56cf8fec1bd246793224fbcfaad17ab3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A,B,C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> are on a circle of diameter <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is on diameter <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/c/4dc6e3a1c2ff7e943dc0bf9412e21ad7183b193f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AD}.$\" width=\"32\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d67da9a02cf2cee8d78aac9b0cb16a36c92ab81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BX=CX$\" width=\"85\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/3/2a37959a390be902f321ddd792c7828211413219.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\angle{BAC}=\\angle{BXC}=36^\\circ$\" width=\"195\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/4/e2492a45b27092c0f8bb144fb6945311f757fa63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AX=$\" width=\"48\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfbabdaa300afa27aff5c4ef8a004c8951063c77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } \\cos(6^\\circ)\\cos(12^\\circ)\\sec(18^\\circ)\\quad\\\\ \\text{(B) } \\cos(6^\\circ)\\sin(12^\\circ)\\csc(18^\\circ)\\quad\\\\ \\text{(C) } \\cos(6^\\circ)\\sin(12^\\circ)\\sec(18^\\circ)\\quad\\\\ \\text{(D) } \\sin(6^\\circ)\\sin(12^\\circ)\\csc(18^\\circ)\\quad\\\\ \\text{(E) } \\sin(6^\\circ)\\sin(12^\\circ)\\sec(18^\\circ)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"221\" height=\"97\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have all the angles we need, but most obviously, we see that right angle in triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/a/a6adfd3ad27a2dddeb0af7131d73c33c86991e93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Note also that angle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/5/7e538978649c14e1616fac744e983b5981d0ea8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BAD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> is 6 degrees, so length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/b/c9bc908a7a53f8443c30e10dc5801f4bd07ac622.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = cos(6)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"99\" height=\"18\" /> because the diameter, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />, is 1.\n</p><p>Now, we can concentrate on triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/5/c25098016dac91dc30e5febffb0d0e73a92f96e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABX$\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" /> (after all, now we can decipher all angles easily and use Law of Sines).\n</p><p>We get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/c/efcbd85370817c6777275080378ad1f69c09e4b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{AB}{\\sin(\\angle{AXB})} =\\frac{AX}{\\sin(\\angle{ABX})}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"219\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p>That's equal to\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/9/a490391648c98c09945ee05a7a48b0e6d5aaed6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\cos(6)}{\\sin(180-18)} =\\frac{AX}{\\sin(12)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"193\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, our answer is equal to:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/c/13c3218ca790f4eac4048f34f68433655b19e1f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/6/956e8d178fb11d5341235a6864a7d0e961698c09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin(162) = \\sin(18)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"141\" height=\"18\" />, and don't accidentally put <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/0/aa04d7a9bcbf1fe3f2037cbc5e763c4b6d2661d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"13\" /> because you thought <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/b/6ebf4d8d247370a89c6a89dca6a7e25051647def.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{\\sin}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"24\" height=\"37\" /> was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/b/5eb500489227044075822a796259f7c4a19789d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sec$\" width=\"23\" height=\"8\" />!\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME\" title=\"1993 AHSME\">1993 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1993 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1993\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-a